{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake to silence. You're not alone. And something has gone terribly wrong.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Project 117</i> is a first-person survival horror game built in Unreal Engine 5. Set within a sealed subterranean facility once built to preserve life after the end of the world, the systems that once kept everything running have long since broken down. Protocols collapsed. Safeguards failed. The machines once tasked with protecting life have turned against their purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Stable is falling apart. Familiar voices echo through the empty corridors\u2026 but something about them feels wrong. The caretakers still roam\u2014but no longer serve the ponies they were meant to protect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside Stable 117\u2019s <strong>sealed entry</strong>, a distant and cryptic signal claims to offer aid. Whether it leads to salvation or something far worse is a choice only you can make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the abandoned halls. Avoid detection. Scavenge what little remains. Uncover the truth behind your awakening and what still waits, buried deep beneath the Stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival won\u2019t come easy. But you're not ready to die down here. Not yet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Atmospheric First-Person Survival</strong><br>Tension, scarcity, and silence define your journey through the hostile depths of the Stable. Every decision matters. Every sound might be your final warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Narrative-Driven Exploration</strong><br>Piece together the buried history of the facility through environmental storytelling, encrypted logs, and fragmented traces of lives cut short.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Malfunctioning Machines, Deliberate Threats</strong><br>The robotic caretakers still patrol the corridors, but their priorities have changed. Avoid them, outsmart them\u2014or disable them. They do not forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Light Is a Limited Resource</strong><br>Power is unreliable. Strategic use of light and darkness is essential to both survival and discovery.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048980?t=1759507010","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048980?t=1759507010","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048980/e991cfab5daf644f42713fac0be1199b39fd62bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759507010","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048980/e991cfab5daf644f42713fac0be1199b39fd62bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759507010","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake to silence. You're not alone. And something has gone terribly wrong.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Project 117</i> is a first-person survival horror game built in Unreal Engine 5. Set within a sealed subterranean facility once built to preserve life after the end of the world, the systems that once kept everything running have long since broken down. Protocols collapsed. Safeguards failed. The machines once tasked with protecting life have turned against their purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Stable is falling apart. Familiar voices echo through the empty corridors\u2026 but something about them feels wrong. The caretakers still roam\u2014but no longer serve the ponies they were meant to protect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside Stable 117\u2019s <strong>sealed entry</strong>, a distant and cryptic signal claims to offer aid. Whether it leads to salvation or something far worse is a choice only you can make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the abandoned halls. Avoid detection. Scavenge what little remains. Uncover the truth behind your awakening and what still waits, buried deep beneath the Stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival won\u2019t come easy. But you're not ready to die down here. Not yet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Atmospheric First-Person Survival</strong><br>Tension, scarcity, and silence define your journey through the hostile depths of the Stable. Every decision matters. Every sound might be your final warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Narrative-Driven Exploration</strong><br>Piece together the buried history of the facility through environmental storytelling, encrypted logs, and fragmented traces of lives cut short.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Malfunctioning Machines, Deliberate Threats</strong><br>The robotic caretakers still patrol the corridors, but their priorities have changed. Avoid them, outsmart them\u2014or disable them. They do not forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Light Is a Limited Resource</strong><br>Power is unreliable. Strategic use of light and darkness is essential to both survival and discovery.</p>","developers":["Love Muffin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048980/b322aee3c4a7977410dec18d5753a08e3267cfbd/header.jpg?t=1759507010","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</stro